<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Vaefesu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya Pauli kwa Vaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vaefesu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vfs</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa vanu va Efeso</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vaefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongocho</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa iyi kwa Vaefeso ikasimbili chipindi kimwi peikasimbilwe baluwa kwa Vakolosai mu myaka gya sitini kuhuma peababilwe suwe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeasimbile ayitambuliche yumwene kuva nde mnjagila Pauli musula lya 1.1. Vakwimba volofu vikwidikila kuva Pauli akasimbile Baluwa kwa Vaefeso ata ndena kwihela ayina lwa luhungilo lweliwoneka mukiganulo kya Vakolosai. Kuhumila na natilo iyi ikawoneka baluwa iyi ilutichwe kwa vamonga lya mapinga va vanu vevamuidikliye Kilisito mu mwani ugo. Paulo ilonga kangi akali mu kiwopo peasimbile baluwa musula lya 3.1, 4.1 na 6.20. Paulo akamgaviye baluwa Tikito mulugendo lwake kugendelela lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Efeso musula lya 6.21-22.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso ukali mwani mkomi hilo na ukali mwani mkomi va filongochi va Valumi kwa mukowa mdodo va Asia. Efeso ukali ucheleka kwa kaye lya kufunyila lya nguluvi mkidala va Vagiliki Alitemi Magito 19.23-31. Lipinga lya vanu ve vamuidikiye Kilisito va ku Efeso likavangile unofu ila pambele sevakaendeliye unofu Ugubutulo 2.1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ihumulila mupono lya kwanza mubaluwa iyi Nguluvi peavahaguwe vanu vake na kuwalowola kuhuma mu sambi chao kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito. Iwananicha Lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito na mvili va Kilisito ndi kituwe na kangi kaye ndi Kilisito ngita liganga likomi lya kulibali lya kaye iyo. Mupono lya pili lya kiganulo Paulo ihumicha malagilicho kwakuva kwikala kwa kumwidikila Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gyegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akwitambucha na kuvahungila Vaefeso musula lya 1.1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi ihumulila umwi mugati lya lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito na mwene. Mu sula lya 1.3—3.21.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kangi isimba vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito peving'ang'wa kwikala musula lya 4.1—6.20.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwiso Paulo akuvalongela makani gya kumalila musula lya 6.21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nene Paulo, mnjagila va Kilisito Yesu kwa lukelo lwa Nguluvi. Ndikuvasimbiliya nyenye vanu va Nguluvi va ukoya ku Efeso, yemuhela likolakola mukwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Ndikuvasukila kwa Nguluvi Daada vetu na kwa Mtwa Yesu Kilisito usanzi na lutengamaso.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufunyo cha Muhe mu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Anjumwe Nguluvi na Daada va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito! Kwakuva, kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito atufunyile kwa kutugavila lufunyo chonda cha Muhe chechigehe kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Inyi peyave kuwumbwa, Nguluvi atuhague nefwe tuveche vanu vake kuchumbila kwiwunga na Kilisito, neke tuveche vanu vake na vetwihela nongwa pautalo lyake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Kwakuva lya lukelo lwake. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Nguluvi akalamule kuvangila dahila tuveche vana vake kwa kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito. Ndeni ndi Nguluvi peasakile na ikamkelise kugita ndeni. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Suwe, tukumhogecha Nguluvi kwa usanzi vake mkomi, weakatugavile hela kwa ng'asi lya Mwana vake yeamkelie! <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kwa danda lya Kilisito nefwe tukomboliwe, sambi chetu chihechiliwe. Ndeni ndi peugehe ukomi va usanzsi vake, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Nguluvi akatugavile hela usanzi ulo vonda ngajila kupwemka!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Kwa uginyange vonda na uchelo vake vonda. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nguluvi akasakile kutuwonesa njowo chake cha lupwepo, asakile kugagita kuchumbila Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Njowo ichi Nguluvi ngachigitile chipindi pachifika, njowo ichi ndi kulundasa pamwi fiwumbe fyonda na kila kinu kuluhano kwa Nguluvi na painyi, filongochwa na Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Finu fyonda hugitwa kuhumila na Nguluvi na peagitile na kulamula na Nguluvi atuhaguwe nefwe tuveche vanu vake mukwiwunga na Kilisito ngita peang'ang'ile mwene, akalamule ndeni kuhuma pamwandi. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Suwe, nefwe yetulonguwe kumhuvilila Kilisito, tung'ang'wa kunjuma ukomi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Na nyenye vanu se Vayawudi mukapulikiche unazi va lya undakyene yani Njowo Nofu chechiletile ulowolo, mumwidikiye Kilisito, neke kuwonesa kuva nyenye ndi va mwene, mwene na kuvikwa gumba kwa kuvagavila yula Muhe va Nguluvi yeatunjagile. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Muhe va Nguluvi uyo nde muhumilicha va gala gonda Nguluvi geajangile vanu vake akutugavila finu fyonda. Lukani ulu ukutulongela ndakyene kuva Nguluvi akuvalowola vanu vonda vevakumwidikila. Tujumwe ukomi vake.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvasukila vanu va Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kwakuva iyo nene kuhuma pendipulike udikilo venu mu Mtwa Yesu na lukelo lwenu kwa vanu vonda va Nguluvi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />sendilekile kuvasukila kwa Nguluvi, ndikuvawuwika kila pendikumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, Daada mkomi avagavile muhe va uginyange na lya ugubutulo neke muvese kumchela hilo. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi agubutule numbula chenu chivese kulola welu vake, muveche kuchela yila ludikilo veavakemelie na ukomi va fupo veavavikile vanu vake, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />muveche kuchela umwimike vake veugehe mkomi hilo kwakuva lya nefwe vetukuidikila. Umwimike uwu ugita kasi mugati lyetu ngita ludali lula lukomi hilo, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />akumchulubucha Kilisito, akamkaliche lubali lwake lwa liwoko lya ndewo. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Ukoya kukwanya Kilisito itavala kila mtavala na kila filongochi, utavala pakyanya lya kila kinu kyekigehe na umwimike, mwene ndi mkomi kuchumba ludali lolonda lwevakuginya vanu vonda. Mwene utavala filongochi va nondee vevagehe muinyi na vala muinyi yeikwacha. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nguluvi akavikile kila kinu filongochwe na Kilisito akamgavile kila kinu na kumgita atavale finu fyonda kwakuva lya lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito ndi mvili gwake, kangi ndi lukwilo lwake mwene nde ikwilichwa kila kinu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhuma mukufuwa mbaka muwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Nyenye ipo pamwandi mukali ngita mufuwe kwakuva lya nongwa na sambi chenu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Chipindi chila mukakaliye kufwatila makani mawofu ga muinyi iyi, mukali mukumdikila Setani mkomi va mahoka va luhano, uyo Setani igita kasi mugani lya vanu sevakumdikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ipo pamwandi, nefwe tukali ngita vene, twikalile kuhumila na ludobeko lwa inyi na kugita makani gala gegikelise mivili na luhala lwetu, nefwe ndeni ndeni tukang'ang'wa kuhigwa na Nguluvi ngita vanu vangi vesevakumdikila Nguluvi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ila Nguluvi nde munya lusungu cholofu, akatukeliye kwa lukelo mkomi, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ata ngita tukali tukafuwe ngajila lya sambi. Akatugitile wumi pamwi na Kilisito. Kwa usanzi va Nguluvi nyenye mutulowolwe. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwa kuvecha pamwi na Kilisito Yesu, Nguluvi akatuchulubucha pamwi na mwene, neke tutavale pamwi na mwene kuluwano. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Neke chipindi kekikwacha aveche kuwonesa wolofu va usanzi vake veseugelwa, veugubutuliwe kwa nefwe kwa kwiunga na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Kwakuva kwa usanzi va Nguluvi mulowilwe kwa ng'asi lya kudikilo. Lukani ulu semahumilo gya magito gyetu ila ndi fupo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Seakavalowola kuhumila na magito gyenu manofu, ndeni munu yoyonda abihile kwidumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nefwe ndi fiwumbe fya Nguluvi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisto Yesu, akatuwumbile neke twikale kwa kugita makani manofu gyeatugitile tugagite.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito avaletile pamwi Vayawudi na se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kwa ndeni, mwiwuke kuva nyenye pamwandi mkali vanu sevayawudi vemukemelwa “Sevadumilwe bina” na Vayawudi vevikwikemala, “Vevadumilwe bina” Ndeni, kudumula bina yeigitwa mumvili va munu kwa mawoko gya munu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Pamwandi mkali mwihela Kilisito, se mukali vanu va Isilaeli. Mukali vagenji na semkali na pono lya gala malagano lyeajangile Nguluvi. Mukali mwihela luhuvililo nde ngita vanu sevamchele Nguluvi baha muinyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ila nondee kwa kwiwuga na Kilisito Yesu, nyenye pamwandi mukali kutali na Nguluvi nondee muhegelichwe kwa kufuwa kwa Kilisito pakipindilihicho. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kwakuva Kilisito mwene atuletiye lutengamaso kwa kuvagita Vayahudi na Vanu se Vayahudi kuvecha pamwi. Kwa mvili vake akatunyuwe wula lukanji veukavahang'anise na kuvagita vachundwama. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kilisito peafuwe pala pakipindilihicho Akaechile ludali lwa lagilicho, kwa kugita ndeni akavagitile avo Vayawudi na se Vayawudi viwunge na Yesu na ndeni akaletile lutengamaso kwa vanu vonda. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kwa ng'asi lya kufuwa pakipindilihicho, akauhecha uchwindama vao Vayawudi na se Vayawudi na kuvavika lipinga limwi. Kangi akavavika vonda kuva va Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Suwe Kilisito akachile akadalike Njowo nofu lya lutengamaso kwa nyenye vanu se Vayahudi vemkali kutali na Nguluvi, kangi kwa Vayawundi vevakali pepi na Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ndeni, kuchumbila mwene Kilisito, nefwe vonda Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi, twivecha kumuhegelela Daada kwa Muhe umwi yula yula.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Suwe, nyenye sevagenji vala vanu se Vayawudi. Nyenye nde vanu pamwi na vanu va Nguluvi na nde vanu va kaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Nyenye muvechile ngita kaye yeichengilwe pakyanya lya kitamiko na kitamiko ikyo nde vanjagila na vavichi, Kilisito Yesu mwene nde liganga likomi lya kitamiko ikyo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Mwene nde vakuhimilicha kaye yonda na kuligita liveche kaye lya Nguluvi kwakuva lya Mtwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwa kwiwunga na mwene, nyenye kangi mwichengwa pamwi na vangi vonda neke mveche kaye lya Nguluvi yeakwikala mugati lyake kwa ng'asi lya Muhe vake.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Kasi lya Paulo kwa vanu se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kwakuva lya ago, nene Paulo nde muwopwa kwakuva lya Kilisito Yesu, ndikuvasukila nyenye vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Kwa undakyene, mpulike suwe kwa usanzi vake Nguluvi akandigavile kasi iyi ndigite kwa kuvatanga nyenye. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Nguluvi akandigubutulila nene lupwepo lwake. Ndisimbile kwa ludodo lukani ulu, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />na nyenye ngamwikwimba gala gyendikavasimbiliye, damwivesa kuchela kuva ndikuimanya unofu lupwepo ulo lwa Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Dahile vanu sevakalongilwe lupwepo ulo, ila nondee Nguluvi avalongile vanjagila na vavichi va Nguluvi kwa kuchumbila Muhe vake. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Lupwepo lwene nde ulu, kuchumbila Njowo Nofu vanu se Vayawudi davipata pono lyao pamwi na vanu Vayawudi mulufunyo chila cha Nguluvi. Vene nde fiwungo fya muvili wulwwula na vivecha pamwi mu njagila yiyila yeagitile Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nene ndigitilwe kuvecha mnyigendwa va Njowo Nofu kwa usanzi vake Nguluvi weanigaviye Nguluvi na umwimike vake mkomi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nene ndo mdodo kuchumba vanu vonda va Nguluvi. Ila andigavile usanzi vake, neke ndivadalikile vanu se Vayawudi umosi ukomi va Kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />na kuvagita vanu vonda vachele lupwepo lwa Nguluvi veufyamile. Nguluvi yeawumbile finu fyonda akafihile lupwepo lwake kuhuma daha, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Nguluvi ing'ang'a vanu vonda vevakumdikila Kilisito vawonese kila munu peagehe na uginyange wonda. Ing'ang'a filongochi na vatavala vevagehe muinyi lya kimuhe vachele ndeni. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Ndeni nde natilo lya Nguluvi kuhuma daha na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito nde yeagitile ago. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Suwe, kwa kwiwugana na Kilisito kwa kumdikila mwene, nefwe twigecha kumuhelela Nguluvi kwa luhuvililo. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ndeni ndikuvasuka mbihile kudenyeka numbula kwakuva lya magudo gyendikugapata kwakuva lya uginyange venu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukelo lwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Kuhumila na natilo ilyo lya Daada ndifugama kuvasukila nyenye, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />mwene ndeawumbila kila kinu kyekigehe kuluhano na muinyi. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi avagite muveche vakakatima kwa kuvagavila ludali munumbula chenu kwa ng'asi lya Muhe vake kwa wolofu va ukomi vake, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />neke Kilisito akale munumbula chenu kwa ng'asi lya kumdikila mwene kangi ndikumsuka avatange muveche vakakatima hilo mulukelo lwake, ndena lukelo lwake uvecha ngita midadikwa na kitamika kya wumi venu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Nguluvi avagavile nyenye pamwi na vanu vake vonda umwimike va kuchela kuva Kilisito atukeliye. Mwene atukeliye kwa lukelo weuhela mwiso. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Ndisuka muvese kuchela lukelo ugo ingava seiwesekana kuchela hilo namuna peugehe mkomi Ena, muvese kuchela lukelo lwa Kilisito peugehe mkomi, baho nde kyanda kyenu dauwana na Daada.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Kwa mwene kwa ludali lwake lwelugita kasi mugati lyetu ivecha kugita makani makomi hilo kuchumba gala gye tuvesa kusuka au kugahocha, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Tung'ang'a vanu voda va Nguluvi vachele kuva Nguluvi ndi mkomi, kila munu yeakumdikila Kilisito na amnjume mwene mbepali na mbepeli! Ndakyene.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kwiwunga kwa vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Suwe, nene ndi ndigehe mukiwopo kwakuva lya kumkumbanikila Mtwa ndikuvasuka hilo mveche na kyanda yeiwana na kwikala kwa nyenye. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Chipindi chonda muveche vakwikwisa na vasosovafu na kwa kuhongechana kwa lukelo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mwigangamiche kuvika umwi veukwacha na Muhe va Nguluvi kwa kwikala pamwi kwa lutengamaso. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nefwe vonda tuwungine ngita fiwungo fya muvili umwi, kangi tugehe na Muhe va Nguluvi yumwi. Ndeni, Nguluvi akatukemeliye na kutuvikila luhuvililo umwi va lukemelo vetu. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Agehe Mtwa yumwi, ludikilo lumwi na ubatiso umwi. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Agehe Nguluvi yumwi na Daada va vonda, yeitavala vanu vonda na yeigita kasi mugati lya vanu vonda na akwikala mugati lya vonda.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ila kila yumwi vetu agavilwe fupo lya Kilisito, kila yumwi akagavilwe ngita peikela yumwene Kilisito kuvagavila. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Peakang'ie kuelela kuluhano kukyanya hilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akavanyamula vawopwa volofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akavagavila vanu vake fupo.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Suwe, peilongwa kuva “Peakakang'ie kukyanya ukoya kuluhano,” Ndi liki? Ndi endena pamwandi akaikile mbaka panyi muinyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Suwe, uyo yeakaikile baha muinyi nde yeakakang'ie kuluhano neke aveche kila pono lya inyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Mwene nde yeavagavile vanu fupo, akavagitile vangi kuvecha vanjagila na vangi vavichi na vangi vaveche vadalika Njowo Nofu na vangi vakwamila va vanu na vawulanichi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Avahaguwe neke vavatange vanu vonda va Nguluvi vavese kugita kasi lyake, neke vanu vevakumdikiya Kilisito veveche vakangafu ngita peugehe mvili va Kilisito yani lipinga lya vanu lyelikumdikila Kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />likani ulo likwendelela mbaka nefwe vonda petuvecha pamwi mukudikila kwetu na mukumchela Mwana va Nguluvi tuvecha vanu vevakangiye na tuvecha ngita Kilisito mwene peagehe. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ndena setuvecha kangi ngita fyali, petutagwa kuno na kuno na kunyamulwa na kila lukala lwa mawulanicho givilonga vanu vadesi, neke vavachange vangi kwa udesi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ila petulongelana undakyene kwa lukelo na kukula mumakani gyonda, ata tumfikile mwene yeagehe kilongochi vetu mwene nde Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Panyi lya ulongochi vake fiwungo fyonda fya mivili fivecha pamwi na mivili gyonda ugelanichwa kwa lutango lwa kila kiwungo. Muvili vonda ukula na kwigelanicha mulukelo, chipindi kila kiwungo pekigita kasi lyake.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwikala umiya mu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Suwe, kwa litawa lya Mtwa, ndikuvalakilila mbihile kwikala kangi ngita vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi, mawocho gyao gavechile upufi ng'ani, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />vanu avo luhala chawo chigehe mukisi. Vagehe kutali na uwumi va Nguluvi kwakuva lya upufi veugehe munumbula chao. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Vanu avo vihela nyoni kangi na pevigita magito gya unjanganifu na vikwendelela kugita makani mawofu neke kwikelesa vavene.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ila pemwiwulaniche makani gya Kilisito semkayiwulaniche kugita makani ngita ago. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ndakyene kuva mukapulike unofu njowo chake, kuno mkali vachulila va Yesu, mukawulanichwe undakyene peugehe mu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Suwe, mwileke kwikala ngita pamwandi, ula umunu venu va pamwandi veukali uhanangwa kwa ludobokelo lwake lwa kuchanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Suwe, mung'ang'wa kugitwa umiya munumbula chenu na mumahocho gyenu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />muveche na uwumi umiya ngita ndeni Nguluvi peavawumbile muwanane na mwene, pemugita makani gegakumkelesa Nguluvi ngajila nogwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Kwa ndena muuleke udesi. Kila yumwi ing'angw'a kumlongela mweyage undakwene, kwakuva kila yumwi vetu nde kiwungo kya mvili va Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ngita mkivipa, mbihile kwidikila luvipo lwenu ivagite mugite sambi na mbihile kwikala na luvipo kigono kyonda. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Mbihile kumgavile fwasi Setani avawese. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Yeakali ihicha, abihile kuhicha kangi ila avange kugita kasi nofu, neke aveche na kinu kya kumtanga munu muhangala. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Njowo njanganifu chibihile kupulikika kangi mugati lyenu. Kila chipindi machowo gyenu gaveche manofu gegakuvatanga vangi, na gyegikuvagelanicha vala vevikuvapulika venu. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mbihile kumgita Muhe va Nguluvi avipe, kwakuva mwene ndi gumba lya Nguluvi kwa nyenye. Yeiwonesha kuva nyenye nde vanu va Nguluvi mbaka kigono kila kya Nguluvi dapeakutukombola. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Suwe, muleke uvavi munumbula chenu na mubilile kulonga kwa kuvipa na mubihile kulonga kyokyonda kyekikuvalemacha vangi. Mbihile kugita kyokyonda kinjanganifu. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Muveche vasanzi na mwiwonele lusungu. Kila yumwi na amulekelele mweyage ngita Nguluvi peakuvalekelela nyenye kuchumbila Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kwikala muwelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ndeni, mwikale kwa kumwigilicha Nguluvi, kwakuva nyenye ndi vana vake yeavakeliye. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mwikale kwa kukelana ngita fila Kilisito peatukeliye na akaihechile yumwene ngita litambiko lyeligehe na manung'unilo manofo na usembe va kumkelesa Nguluvi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Kwakuva nyenye ndi vanu va Nguluvi, suwe usasi na uhafu vovonda ula awu uwimi ubihile kutambuchwa mugati lyenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kangi mbihile kulonga machowo lya nyoni na gaupufi awu kidada, Ila mumhongeche Nguluvi chipindi chonda. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Kwa njowo lya makani aga aveche msasi yoyonda awu muhafu awu mwimi, munu uyo ndi ngita injuma ling'omong'omo. Na munu yoyonda yeagehe ngita uyo seipata kyokyonda muung'achale va Kilisito na va Nguluvi.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mbihile kuchangwa na munu kwa njowo njanganifu, kwakuva kwa makani ngita ago luvipo lwa Nguluvi ikuvafikila vonda sevakumwidikila. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Suwe, mbihile kuvecha pamwi navo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Pamwandi nyenye mkali mukisi, ila nondee nyenye mgehe muwelu kwa kwiwunga na Mtwa. Mwikale ngita vana va muwelu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />vanu vevagehe muwelu vigita njowo nofu na masanzi na ga undakyene chipindi chonda. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mugeche kusaka gala gye gakumkelesa Mtwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mbihile kugagita magito gyegigitwa na vanu vevagehe mukisi, ila muvalongele vanu kuva makani ago semanofu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kwakuva makani gyegigitwa kwa lupwepo na vanu vawofu ndi nyoni ata kugalonga. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ila welu uwonesa wachi kuva makani ago se manofu, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />na kila kyekiwoneswa wachi kivecha welu. Gasimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Lamwike veve yeuvasile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">uchulubuke kuhuma kwa vevafuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">nave Kilisito daakukung'alichila welu vake.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Suwe, mulolele pemukwikala. Mbihile kwikala ngita vapufi, ila ngita vene uginyange. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mwitumile unofu muda vemugehe navo kwakuva figono ifi ndi chauwofu <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ndeni, mbihile kuvecha vapufi, ila ing'ang'wa msake gala Mtwa ikela mugagite.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mbihile kugala ugimbi kwakuva iyo daikugita ugite makani gya nyoni, ila mumemechwe Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Mulonge kwa machowo gya sabuli, lusambo na tensi cha Muhe va Nguluvi, mumusomoliye Mtwa kwa kumunjuma Mtwa munumbula chenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Figono fyonda, mumuhongeche Nguluvi Daada kwa makani gyonda, kwa umwimike va Mtwa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadala na vagosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila yumwi amginye mweyage kwakuva lya uginyage vemugehe navo kwa Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Vadala vavaginye vagosi vao ngita pemukumdikila Mtwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kwakuva mgosi ndi kilongochi va mdala vake, ngita kilisito peagehe kilongochi pakyanya lya lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito. Nave Kilisito yumwene akulikombola lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito, mwene ndi muvili vake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ngita fila lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikie Kilisito, pelikumdikila Kilisito, ndeni ndeni vadala vavadikile vagosi vawo mumakani gyonda.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Na nyenye vagosi muvakele vadala venu ngita Kilisito peakalikeliye lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikie Kilisito, akayihechile yumwene usembe kwakuva lya mwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Akagitile ndene, neke kwa luchowo lwake aling'aliche lipinga lya vanu lyelikumwidikila Kilisito kuvecha vanu va Nguluvi, kwa kuwogoficha na malenga, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />neke ipatile lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikie Kilisito vevagehe unofu hilo, lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikie Kilisito vevihela uvifyi awu nongwa awu kyokyonda kya namuna ilyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Suwe, vagosi ving'ang'wa kuvakela vadala vawo ngita mivili gyawo, munu yeakumkela mdala vake akwiikela yumwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwihela munu yeukuvipila mvili vake yumwene, ila akuwugavila kyakula na kuuvika unofu. Ngita Kilisito peakuvavika unofu vanu vevamuidikiye kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kwakuva nefwe ndi fiwungo fya mvili vake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Ndeni mgosi akumleka daada vake na maye vake, daakwiwunga na mdala vake, navo vavili davivecha mvili umwi.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Njowo ichi chigehe na lupwepo lukomi, ila nene ndilonga makani gya Kilisito na lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikie Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ila na nyenye ndikuvalongela vonda kuva, mgosi ing'ang'wa kumkela mdala vake ngita peikwikela yumwene na mdala ing'ang'wa amginye mgosi vake.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Vana na vasasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Nyenye vana muvadikile valelo venu ngita peing'angwa kwa vanu vevamwidikile Kilisito, kwakuva kwa kugita ndeni kukumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Malagilicho ga Nguluvi gilonga, “Muvapulikiche daada na maye vako,” Iyi ndi lulagilicho lya kwanja leligehe na jangila, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />neke, “Uveche na lufunyo na kwikala myaka myolofu muinyi.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Na nyenye vadaada mubihile kuvavipicha vana venu, ila muvalele muuginyange na muvawulaniche gya Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasutu na vakomi vawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Nyenye vasutu muvapulikiche vakomi venu baha muinyi kwa uginyange na kuvadikila mugite ndeni kwa numbula yonda, ngita pemukumpulikicha Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mubihile kuvagitila unofo chipindi avo vakomi pekuvalola, neke vavanjume. Ila mveche mkuvagitila ngita vanyingendwa va Kilisito, mgite kwa numbula lyonda ngita peing'ang'a Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mugite kasi chenu kwa numbula yonda, ngita fila mu kumgitila kasi Mtwa na sevanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mwiwiwuke kuva kila munu yeigita manofu, aveche vasutu awu sevasutu, daiwanuka fupo lyake kuhuma kwa Mtwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Na nyenye vakomi, muvagitile unofu vasutu venu na mbihile kuvaogofya. Muwiwuke kuva nyenye ndeni ndeni ngita vawo, mugehe na Mtwa yulayula va kuluhano na mwene seigita kwaumwilila.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluvi akututanga kuvecha vakangafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ndeni, ndikuvang'ang'ila muveche vakangafu kwa kwiwunga na Mtwa na kwa kutangwa na ludali vake ngomi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mufwale fyalukilo fyonda fya kwitovela fyeavagavile Nguluvi neke muveche kuchipinja natilo njanganifu cha Setani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Setukwitova na vanu, ila tukwitova na vatavala na mahoka gyegitavala na gyegigehe na ludali lya kila ayina muinyi iyi na mahoka gegitavala kisi muinyi lya vanu vevafuwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ndena mufwale fyalukilo fyonda fya Ngulivi, neke muwese kwitova mukigono kya uwofu dakikwacha. Na dapemsindile fita mwendelele kuvecha vakangafu.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Suwe, mwime ukangafu, undakyene va Nguluvi, uveche ngita fila mpuga peyivopa lufunga mukigudi kuyivika unofu neke awese kutovana fita. Kangi, ngita fila mpuga peifwala ngao mukihafu neke ayidime na misale na migoha mufita, ndeni ndeni na nyenye mung'ang'wa muveche na kyanda kinofu neke muyidime na Setani, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />na ludoboko lya kudalika Njowo Nofu lya lutengamaso iveche ngita makobasi mumagulu gyenu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Figono fyonda kudikila kwa nyenye kuveche ngita ngawu mumawoko gyenu, ivagite muwese kuchima msale gya lyoto gya yula Setani. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Muwanuke ulowolo uveche ngita kofila lya kyuma na luchowo lwa Nguluvi ngita lipanga lyemugavilwa na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Muveche musuka figono fyonda, kwa masuko gogonda ngita Muhe va Nguluvi peakuvalongocha. Mulolele hilo kwakuva lya lukani ulo kila chipindi na mbihile kufwahila kuvasukila vanu vonda va Nguluvi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Munisukile na nene neke pendiywanga Nguluvi anigavile kya kulonga, nivese kuvalongela vanu lupwepo lwa Njowo Nofu kwa ukakatima. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Nene nde mnanzi va Njowo Nofu na kasi iyo nde yeindigitile ndiwopwe. Munisukile neke ndiwese kudalika kwa ukakatima ngita peing'ang'wa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo imalisila balua lyake kwa kuhungila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Lukolo vetu, Tikiko yeakumgumbanikila Nguluvi unofu hilo, dakuvalongela njowo changu chonda neke muchele kyendikigita nondee. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ndikumlagicha kwa nyenye neke avalongele njowo chetu neke avanamache.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ndikumsukila kwa Nguluvi Daada na kuhuma kwa Mtwa Yesu Kilisito nyenye lukolo avagavile lutengamaso na lukelo na ludikilo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi aveche msanzi kwa nyenye vonda vemukumkela Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito kwa lukelo seuhela mwiso.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>